Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Theatre of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the story of a woman who was heading home on the last train.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Service for today has ended. Thank you very much for riding with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you waiting for your mom or dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.59,0:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you live nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, do you want to walk back with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get into a fight with your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for asking so many questions you don't want to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.73,0:00:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That room on the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't want to go back.!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your mom do something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do in a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.83,0:01:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose? Choose what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.27,0:01:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I choose you to be my new mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.27,0:01:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.83,0:01:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought your child back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.31,0:01:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any children.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was a little boy at the station...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment ago, there was a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.97,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're saying makes no sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.85,0:01:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So you do have children after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear them too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, why are they still so loud even after dying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Maybe you should go check on your children...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did things turn out like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave, go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Three months later,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband was overjoyed with our first child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't get that boy from that night out of my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy's words...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.39,0:02:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As he grew up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,my child began to look more and more like the boy from that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt a strange uneasiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and I couldn't fully love this child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Taku-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.51,0:02:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that apartment from that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is still here, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the babies who died before they could learn how to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why all they could do back then was cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Taku-chan, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See? They're all jealous of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was the one who got to become your child, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... can I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I choose someone to be my baby brother or sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The end
